From 236eab7a8006097e331b627f407f58db8c521d46 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Kreijstal <elektrischrainbow@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 16:05:34 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] product: restrict org.apache.ant to the packaged 1.10.15
 bundle

The community products restrict the target platform's org.apache.ant
plug-in to version 1.99.1. That version is not an Apache Ant release but
a stub published in DBeaver's p2 repository ("Apache Ant minimum
package", vendor DBeaver Corp): seven classes exporting only
org.apache.tools.ant.types.selectors, which is what Eclipse quick search
(org.eclipse.text.quicksearch, part of the CE product) uses from the
org.apache.ant bundle it requires with bundle-version 1.10.0 or later.
The stub is a binary artifact without a corresponding source release.

MSYS2 packages Apache Ant 1.10.15, built from source, as the OSGi bundle
org.apache.ant 1.10.15 (eclipse-orbit-ant), and quick search is built
against it. Restrict the filter to 1.10.15 so a Tycho build of the CE
and Microsoft Store products resolves against the same Ant bundle as the
MSYS2 product assembly.
---
 product/community-msstore/pom.xml | 2 +-
 product/community/pom.xml         | 2 +-
 2 files changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/product/community-msstore/pom.xml b/product/community-msstore/pom.xml
index 4c12ce8..30cc1a8 100644
--- a/product/community-msstore/pom.xml
+++ b/product/community-msstore/pom.xml
@@ -61,7 +61,7 @@
                             <type>eclipse-plugin</type>
                             <id>org.apache.ant</id>
                             <restrictTo>
-                                <version>1.99.1</version>
+                                <version>1.10.15</version>
                             </restrictTo>
                         </filter>
                     </filters>
diff --git a/product/community/pom.xml b/product/community/pom.xml
index e1a4773..5fd0406 100644
--- a/product/community/pom.xml
+++ b/product/community/pom.xml
@@ -54,7 +54,7 @@
                             <type>eclipse-plugin</type>
                             <id>org.apache.ant</id>
                             <restrictTo>
-                                <version>1.99.1</version>
+                                <version>1.10.15</version>
                             </restrictTo>
                         </filter>
                     </filters>
-- 
2.55.0

